      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58fb072c4308451d",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Yutong Zhang 和其他 7 位作者撰写、题为《INTENT-AS-A-TOOL 让追踪智能体失准变得容易》的论文 PDF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
